Developer Certificate of Origin, Version 1.1
Text is published at https://developercertificate.org/ under the terms stated there
(verbatim copying permitted, changing not allowed). Copy the official text into a file
named DCO at the repository root; it is not reproduced here to avoid altering it.

Usage summary: every commit needs a line
  Signed-off-by: Random J Developer <random@developer.example.org>
Produce it with:  git commit -s
